  "description": "Seorim wants to spend a perfect Christmas with his lover, so he tries to book a hotel — only to be crushed by the outrageous prices. But just as he’s about to give up, he wins the lottery?!\n\nA special Christmas side story to [My X Report](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series.html?id=35738920748)!\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/my_x_mas), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/hotel_christmas)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/x-mas_report), [T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/my_x_mas)\n\n***Note:**  \nPart of Penis Navida: [Hotel XMAS](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series.html?id=3350491531) 2020 event by Bomtoon, this is Story 3 (Ch.8-10) on Lezhin*",
